# Files excluded from the Comfy Registry archive.
#
# Everything here stays on GitHub; none of it is needed by ComfyUI at runtime.
# Entries are either paths that exist today or glob guards for artefacts a
# developer may create locally. Dead entries were removed in the 2026-08
# cleanup — a list naming files that no longer exist reads as coverage it does
# not have.

# ── VCS, CI and build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.github/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
node_modules/
package.json

# ── Caches and local scratch ────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
.ruff_cache/
.codex-backup-*/
# Session-scratch directory names. These do not exist right now and are kept
# deliberately: tests/test_package_cleanup.py pins them, because each one has
# appeared in this repo before and none of them may ever ship.
_to_delete/
_audit_tmp/
.agents/
.phase3-dist/
.phase3-dist-final/
.phase3-venv/
*.log
*.map
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.patch

# ── Tests and developer tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────
tests/
js/tests/
tools/check_mojibake.py
tools/check_release_ready.py
tools/gpu_acceptance.py
tools/build_node_reference.py

# ── Repository documentation ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Node descriptions and input tooltips ship inside the package and ComfyUI
# renders them on hover, so the reference travels with the nodes. The prose
# lives at www.fxtdstudios.com.
CONTRIBUTING.md
KNOWN_ISSUES.md
# The generated node reference (docs/nodes) is for GitHub readers; the same
# text ships inside the nodes as hover tooltips.
docs/

# ── Internal write-ups, should any reappear ─────────────────────────────────
# Audits, reviews and session logs go stale and mislead. Findings that matter
# belong in the README's Status & to-do list, KNOWN_ISSUES.md or the changelog.
AUDIT.md
FULL_AUDIT_*.md
BATCH*_REPORT.md
RELEASE_REVIEW.md
VIEWER_REPORT.md
PACKAGE_REVIEW.md
PRE_RELEASE_REVIEW.md
CLEANUP_REPORT.md
SESSION_LOG.md
ADR-*.md
DEBUG-*.md
RELEASE_NOTES_*.md
RADIANCE_v*_RELEASE_NOTES.md
bug_report_reply_draft.md
gpu_acceptance_report.md
*.docx

# ── Local project data ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The starter graph and TEMPLATES/ ship; anything else under workflows/ is the
# user's own shot work. A wheel built on a working machine once shipped the
# developer's shot files.
workflows/*.rad
workflows/.versions/
workflows/.asset_thumbs/
core/*.db
